    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe alisobele ishiwi lyakwe palwa calo ca Israeli. Ifi efyasosa Yawe uwaandalika umulu, uwabumba ne isonde, uwapanga no mupashi wa muntu mu nda yakwe. Eulesosa ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ine nkacita Yerusalemu ngo lukombo lwa fikola, abantu ba mishobo imbi iyashinguluka Yerusalemu bakanwamo, no kupungaila bakalapungaila ku lwakukolwa. Ilyo bakatebelela umusumba wa Yerusalemu, ne misumba imbi yonse iya mu calo ca Yuda nayo bakaitebelela no kuilwisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo nshita nga yafika, ilyo abantu ba mishobo yonse iya pano isonde bakakumbinkana no kuwililila umusumba wa Yerusalemu, ine nkaucita nge cilibwe icafinisha, na bantufye bonse abakeshako ukucimya, imisana yabo ikafunaika nganshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali bulya bushiku ine ne Yawe nkapupanya bakabalwe babo bonse, nkapenya na bonse abakalaendelapo.” Efyasosa Yawe. “Aba ŋanda yakwa Yuda nkalabalinda, lelo bakabalwe ba balwani babo bena ine nkabapofusha amenso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo intungulushi sha bena Yuda shikalaebana mu mitima ashiti, ‘Ala ni Yawe umwine wa fita eutukosha ifwe fwe bantu bakwe, fwe baikala muno Yerusalemu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pali bulya bushiku ine nkacita indupwa sha bena Yuda shikabe ngo mulilo uuleyaka mu mutengo umo, nangu mwibala limo umuli imyanshi ya ŋanu iilepya. Abena Yuda aba ebakalofya abantu ba mitundu yonse iyaba mupepi ku kulyo nangu ku kuso. Nomba abena Yerusalemu bena bakashala nabekalilila pa ncende yabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe akabalilapo ukupususha amayanda ya bena Yuda, epakuti umucinshi wa ba ŋanda yakwa Davidi pamo no wa bena Yerusalemu wikacila umucinshi uo na bena Yuda bakakwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali bulya bushiku Yawe akalacingililako abena Yerusalemu, icakuti no tufwanda twabo twine tukaba no bulamba nga bulya bwine bwakweteko Davidi. Aba ŋanda yakwa Davidi ebakalabatungulula nga Lesa wine, kwati ni malaika wakwa Yawe alebatungulula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali bulya bushiku ine nkatampa ukulalofya abantu ba mishobo yonse abakalawililila umusumba wa Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
