              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mateo 24:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ubuso 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nomba pa ba ŋanda yakwa Davidi na pali bonse abaikala mu Yerusalemu nkapongolwelapo umupashi wakukwatisha uluse no wakupapata. Bakandolesha, pali uyo bapulinkanyamo icanso, bakamuloosha nga filya fine baloosha umwana mwaume uwabafye umo mpo. Bakamuloosha kwati bantu bafwililwe umwana wabo umwaume uwe beli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali bulya bushiku mu musumba wa Yerusalemu mukaba imisowa iyikalamba, nga ilya ine yumfwika mwiwanga lya Megido, ilyo abantu baloosha Hadadi Rimoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hadadi Rimoni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "E milungu ya mu calo ca Kenani na mu calo ca Siria. Ilyo balebyala no kutanda, nga fyamena elyo kabili fyaonaika, ninshi abantu bena kulaloosha umulungu wa mufundo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indupwa shonse mu calo shikalaloosha ulu lweka, ulu nalo lweka. Ulupwa lwa ba ŋanda yakwa Davidi abaume bakalaloosha beka, abakashi babo nabo beka. Ulupwa lwa ba ŋanda yakwa Natani abaume bakalaloosha beka, abakashi babo nabo beka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulupwa lwa ba ŋanda yakwa Levi abaume bakalaloosha beka, abakashi babo nabo beka. Ulupwa lwa ba ŋanda yakwa Shimei abaume bakalaloosha beka, abakashi babo nabo beka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mu ndupwa shimbi shonse lumo lumo ishashala, abaume bakalaloosha beka, abakashi babo nabo beka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
